      "Four-axis score — peptide 0/5 (no direct peptide component; though Boltz-1 is increasingly used for peptide-structure-prediction-and-design downstream); AI-agent infrastructure 4/5 (mechanistic-interpretability of foundation-models is the canonical input for AI-DD foundation-model-engineering — understanding WHERE and HOW information flows in the trunk-diffusion enables targeted-steering for protein-ligand-binding-affinity optimization); longevity 3/5 (protein-ligand-co-design has direct longevity implications via accelerating drug-discovery for age-related-diseases); cost 4/5 (Boltz-1 inference is moderate-cost, mechanistic-interpretability-experiments require modest-compute for probing / activation-patching / representation-engineering interventions). The signal is actionable from the BB AI-DD service stack as a Boltz-1-mechanistic-interpretability + trunk-diffusion-steering + structure-based-drug-design brief.",
      "Why it matters for BB + action — Ingest the Boltz-1 trunk-diffusion paper (arxiv 2608.11475) and reproduce the mechanistic-interpretability-experiments on the BB GPU pool (Boltz-1 is open-weights, deployable locally), benchmark the probing + steering methodology against the BB protein-ligand-co-design task-suite (benchmark-datasets: PDBBind, CrossDocked2020, the BindingDB-derived test-set, the DAVIS / KIBA kinase-inhibition-datasets), integrate the DBMol small-molecule-design methodology (arxiv 2607.19237) for end-to-end target-to-hit-pipeline (Boltz-1 backbone + DBMol small-molecule-generator + physics-based-refinement + property-prediction), integrate the UMA-Inverse ligand-conditioned protein-inverse-folding methodology (arxiv 2607.07866) for protein-design-loop-closure, identify the trunk-diffusion-boundary positions where ligand-conditional-information-flow is maximal and design targeted-steering-interventions to bias the model toward desired binding-geometries + physicochemical-properties (logP, TPSA, MW, HBD/HBA count, Lipinski-rule-of-five compliance, QED-score, synthetic-accessibility-score). The first deliverable should be a 3-page Boltz-1-mechanistic-interpretability + trunk-diffusion-steering + DBMol/UMA-Inverse-integration brief, not a drug-candidate.",
